[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0041","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0041.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-0578","title":"Adobe Flash Player 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 10.2.152.26 之前版本中存在内存破坏漏洞，由于对特定 ActionScript 3 对象的构造函数缺乏正确的类型检查，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意构造的网页或打开特制的 Flash 文件触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响 Windows、macOS、Linux 等多平台，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。Adobe 已在安全更新 10.2.152.26 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-0578"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-02-10T16:00:32Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:27:40Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.2.152.26 或更高版本（官方安全公告 APSB11-02）。Windows 用户可通过 Adobe 官网下载安装，Linux 用户应用 Red Hat RHSA-2011-0206/0259/0368 或 SUSE 对应补丁。由于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止支持，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 标准，从根本上消除此类内存破坏漏洞风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.sun.com/security/entry/multiple_vulnerabilities_in_adobe_flash2","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-02/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/70921","http://secunia.com/advisories/43267","http://secunia.com/advisories/43292","http://secunia.com/advisories/43340","http://secunia.com/advisories/43351","http://secunia.com/advisories/43747","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-02.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0206.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0259.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0368.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/46195","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1025055","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0348","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0383","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0402","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0646","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-11-081/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/65240","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13205","https://oval.cis